"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4805740","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1847286114032255","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"announcement","title":"Road to 1.0 #1: 16 languages, new mods and a big balance pass","summary":"Hey runzies ! Next Fest is still on, and while you were playing the demo, our playtesters were busy breaking the full game. We shipped 5 playtest updates in two weeks, so here's a roundup of what changed on the way to the November 13 launch. RUNZ speaks your language The full game now ships in 16 languages: English, French, Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, German, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Simplified and Traditional Chinese, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Turkish, Ukrainian and Indonesian. Bosses got lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:24:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032255","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:11:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1846651706691250","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"announcement","title":"RUNZ dev stream - Next Fest","summary":"RUNZ is in Steam Next Fest, and I'm streaming the full game live right here to show people how awesome this game is.Come hang out while I play and try to dive deeper, try out bullet synergies and star upgrades, and answer your questions about the game and its development. Chat is open!Want to play too? The free demo is on this page all week! If you like it, a wishlist helps a ton !","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:55:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691250","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1846651706690801","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"announcement","title":"runz is in Steam Next Fest ! Free demo all week","summary":"Hey runzies !runz is part of Steam Next Fest, from October 19 to 26, and the free demo is right there on the store page. If you never tried it, now is the perfect time. If you did, it got a big update on October 5, so it's worth another run.Quick reminder of how it works: you survive timed waves, then spend your money in a shop that sells bullets. Your magazine fires them in order, slot by slot, then reloads. 3 copies of a bullet merge into a stronger one, bullets sharing a tag turn on synergies","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:32:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1845383656394315","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"update","title":"Beta 0.9 Playtest and Demo update!","summary":"IT'S ONLINE ! Hey folks, I have some great news for you. runz demo has been updated with the latest changes, and we also have a playtest setup on a demo beta branch. For the full game playtest, you need to join our discord and the code will be available there. We really enjoy the game in its current state, but we need exterior feedback. It's hard for us to be critical and objective, especially on balance. The game in its current state should be easy-ish to beat the first difficulty, and really h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T18:11:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1835871199309363","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch notes v0.1.5","summary":"RUNZIES !Come claim the title of BEST RUNZIE by putting up your runz scores on the fresh leaderboard! You asked, we delivered. You will now be able to compette with other runzies from every other part of the world. You will now find a leaderboard in the main menu screen, and a detailed leaderboard menu where you can customize your name, sort by anything you deem worthy, or even check out your own progression ! You can also click on any score the check the build that was used to get this score. D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T13:27:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1835236783561297","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch notes v0.1.46","summary":"What's up runzies? What you can expect from this small patch is some functional navigation when using controllers, some huge money pickup frustration nerf with a money bag system inherited from the best and better attraciton range, as well as other things and some secret sauce : Added bagged money : money left on the ground at round end is now saved and added back into future money dropsMoved the money HUD under the HP panel and added the bagged money counter thereIncreased the money pickup magn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T17:17:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783561297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1835236783557061","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch notes v0.1.45","summary":"Hello runzies ! We have been hard at work to work on various feedback you communicated. Here's a detail of this small patch :Reworked the enchant screen so players enchant the real magazine directly, with clearer slot highlighting and stronger visual feedbackPolish the shop layout so the magazine, workbench, mod slots and outlines line up betterAdded a Display Mode setting with Fullscreen, Borderless Windowed and Windowed optionsFix fullscreen issues with window close and focus lossAdded a red p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T09:59:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783557061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1834602721201134","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"announcement","title":"RUNZ demo RELEASED tomorrow for Steam bullet fest !","summary":"Hello Gamers, Runzers, friends, and all in-between,We are proud and happy to announce that RUNZ demo has been released for free on steam ! We are excited to share with you this \"magazine builder\", which brings together auto-battler style economy management, theorycrafting and building, with bullet-hell / twin-stick shooter's arcady and nervous gameplay. This demo is a good preview of the game in terms of what you can expect gameplay wise - but of course, we plan on having a ton more content for ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T08:29:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201134","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704420-1834602721200129","game_id":"steam-4704420","kind":"update","title":"runz demo hotfix #1","summary":"Here's a detail of this very small patch : Added additional arrows in tutorial so players understand that they need to sell all their bulletsFix some issues related to stinger when it rewards bulletsFix some translations about burn synergyThanks for playing !","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T20:28:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4704420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4704420":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4704420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z"},"4805740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:02Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4704420","app_id":4704420,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"9c28500f1344e60b8bff62c98a11cddf03f07aaf4766b9b27554bfa63f3455eb","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"RUNZ에서는 탄창 속 모든 탄환이 중요합니다. 점점 거세지는 웨이브에서 살아남고 독창적인 업그레이드 시스템을 익히세요. 시너지를 만들고, 탄환을 조합하고, 자금을 관리하며 총을 강화하는 오토 배틀러 요소의 트윈 스틱 슈터입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"sardin-ventures","creator_clan_account_id":46109968}],"developers":[{"name":"sardin-ventures","creator_clan_account_id":46109968}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791